# RC-009 — Intelligence Layer Foundation

North star: **ORACLY grows with the user over months and years — invisibly today.**

## Before adding intelligence features ask

- Does data persist through canonical repositories — not through AI services directly?
- Does new code read via `IntelligenceRepository` / `IntelligenceLayerService`?
- Is the change internal only — no new UI or navigation in RC-009 scope?
- Can future features plug in without refactoring storage?

If any answer is no — revise.

## Canonical doc

`docs/RC-009.md`

## Out of scope

Redesign · navigation changes · user flow changes · unfinished UI

## Success

User notices nothing today. Foundation ready for Personal Insights, Timeline, Themes, Growth Journey.
